    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\n\nI am afraid this *directly* goes against explicit single goal of 'mini.bufremove' to close buffer [while saving window layout](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/3ad46cdb7a51281e0024416023b56cf5c7909ae7/doc/mini-bufremove.txt#L9-L10). The built-in `:bwipeout` (or `:bw`) and `:bdelete` (or `:bd`) do exactly what is described here.\n\nClosing as not planned.",
